{"id":"t4-hafazan","tahap":"T4","nama":"Hafazan (KAFA)","sk":"Hafazan","ikon":"📖","warna":"#7A5AB8","bahasa":"ms","kur":"KAFA Tahun 4 (hafazan Juz 'Amma)","semak":"pending ustaz review","jawi":true,"versi":"0.5.67","sumber":"Year 4 hafazan surahs; Quran text from the app's KFGQPC Uthmani data; meanings are short summaries pending an ustaz's review; shown in full Jawi.","topik":[{"id":"t4-hafazan-1","nama":"Surah Asy-Syams","soalan":[{"j":"mcq","s":"Surah Asy-Syams mempunyai ______ ayat.","p":["lima belas","tiga belas","empat belas","enam belas"],"a":"lima belas","aras":1,"id":"t4-hafazan-1.6a5c8c"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Surah Asy-Syams ialah surah ______.","p":["Makkiyyah","Madaniyyah"],"a":"Makkiyyah","aras":1,"id":"t4-hafazan-1.a70b6e"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Maksud nama Surah Asy-Syams ialah ______.","p":["Matahari","Waktu fajar","Hari kiamat yang menyelubungi","Yang Maha Tinggi"],"a":"Matahari","aras":1,"id":"t4-hafazan-1.bdebf0"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat pertama Surah Asy-Syams ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلشَّمْسِ وَضُحَـٰهَا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">لَآ أُقْسِمُ بِهَـٰذَا ٱلْبَلَدِ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلْفَجْرِ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">هَلْ أَتَـٰكَ حَدِيثُ ٱلْغَـٰشِيَةِ</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلشَّمْسِ وَضُحَـٰهَا</span>","aras":2,"id":"t4-hafazan-1.805ccc"},{"j":"isi","s":"Surah Asy-Syams ialah surah yang ke-91 dalam ______.","bank":["al-Quran","hadis","kitab Taurat","buku cerita"],"a":"al-Quran","aras":2,"id":"t4-hafazan-1.5fcd69"},{"j":"bs","s":"Surah Asy-Syams ialah surah Makkiyyah.","a":"Betul","aras":1,"id":"t4-hafazan-1.f5bb97"},{"j":"bs","s":"Surah Asy-Syams mempunyai enam belas ayat.","a":"Salah","aras":1,"id":"t4-hafazan-1.8dd9f6"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat terakhir Surah Asy-Syams ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">وَلَا يَخَافُ عُقْبَـٰهَا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">وَٱدْخُلِى جَنَّتِى</span>","<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ إِنَّ عَلَيْنَا حِسَابَهُم</span>","<span class=\"arab\">صُحُفِ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَمُوسَىٰ