-Buruj.","susunan":["وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلْبُرُوجِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْمَوْعُودِ","وَشَاهِدٍ وَمَشْهُودٍ","قُتِلَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْأُخْدُودِ","ٱلنَّارِ ذَاتِ ٱلْوَقُودِ"],"aras":3,"id":"t4-hafazan-7.c22270"},{"j":"bs","s":"Orang beriman tetap teguh walaupun diseksa.","a":"Betul","aras":1,"id":"t4-hafazan-7.c9162a"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Pengajaran Surah Al-Buruj ialah ______.","p":["allah membalas orang yang zalim","orang yang mengotori jiwanya akan rugi","kita berpesan-pesan dengan sabar dan kasih sayang","kita memuliakan anak yatim"],"a":"allah membalas orang yang zalim","aras":2,"id":"t4-hafazan-7.f9c304"},{"j":"susun","s":"Susun ayat yang terakhir dalam Surah Al-Buruj.","susunan":["بَلِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ فِى تَكْذِيبٍ","وَٱللَّهُ مِن وَرَآئِهِم مُّحِيطُۢ","بَلْ هُوَ قُرْءَانٌ مَّجِيدٌ","فِى لَوْحٍ مَّحْفُوظِۭ"],"aras":3,"id":"t4-hafazan-7.561909"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat ke-12 Surah Al-Buruj ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ بَطْشَ رَبِّكَ لَشَدِيدٌ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ فَتَنُواْ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَتُوبُواْ فَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ جَهَنَّمَ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ ٱلْحَرِيقِ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">وَهُوَ ٱلْغَفُورُ ٱلْوَدُودُ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلْبُرُوجِ</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ بَطْشَ رَبِّكَ لَشَدِيدٌ</span>","aras":3,"id":"t4-hafazan-7.bb3fc9"}]},{"id":"t4-hafazan-8","nama":"Ulang kaji hafazan Tahun 4","soalan":[{"j":"padankan","s":"Padankan surah dengan maksud namanya.","pasangan":[["Asy-Syams","Matahari"],["Al-Balad","Negeri"],["Al-Fajr","Waktu fajar"],["Al-A'la","Yang Maha Tinggi"]],"aras":2,"id":"t4-hafazan-8.cdfeab"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Surah yang paling panjang di antara berikut ialah Surah ______.","p":["Al-Fajr","Asy-Syams","At-Tariq","Al-A'la"],"a":"Al-Fajr","aras":2,"id":"t4-hafazan-8.c78f1a"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Surah yang menceritakan unta Nabi Salih ialah Surah ______.","p":["Asy-Syams","Al-Balad","Al-Buruj","At-Tariq"],"a":"Asy-Syams","aras":2,"id":"t4-hafaza